			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790750101,
					"content": "肖维涅到底在想什么呢？唉，他就是不愿意和我说话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750102,
					"content": "关于肖维涅…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750103,
					"content": "您好，两位。很抱歉…肖维涅准是还在生我的气，不肯出来和我说话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750104,
					"content": "唉，可是那底下既吹不到风，也照不到太阳，要是他枯萎了可怎么办呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750105,
					"content": "那个…既然是一盆花的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750106,
					"content": "我们可以直接把他捧出来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750107,
					"content": "我试过了。但肖维涅一直在生闷气，我根本没办法靠近他…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750108,
					"content": "他的气太大，我都差点被吹走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750109,
					"content": "等一下，为什么生气会把人吹跑啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750110,
						790750111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750110,
					"content": "这气也太大了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750112,
					"content": "也许是我之前拒绝和肖维涅一起远行，让他不高兴了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750113,
					"content": "两位客人，能请你们去看看肖维涅吗？说不定，你们能劝得动他。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750114,
					"content": "没问题，我们去试试。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750115,
					"content": "嗯，我们去过好多地方旅行，也见了好多人，一定…说不定真能劝得动他呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750116,
					"content": "那就太好了！肖维涅就在这座岛下面的洞窟里，请你们去那边找他吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750117,
					"content": "我…我要打扫打扫这里，给肖维涅找一个最适合晒太阳的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "帕纽尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750111,
					"content": "确实很不想让人靠近呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750112
					]
				}
			]
		},
